WEBVTT

00:00.230 --> 00:07.690
Labyrinth Story.

01:13.970 --> 01:15.800
Cicerone.

01:17.140 --> 01:19.300
Cicerone.

01:20.430 --> 01:21.680
Where are you?

01:27.600 --> 01:29.150
Cicerone.

01:30.770 --> 01:32.480
Cicerone.

01:32.505 --> 01:39.530
Labyrinth ♪ Labyrinthos

02:39.180 --> 02:44.430
The name, "Cicerone", did
your father give him that name?

02:45.430 --> 02:48.310
Cicerone named himself that.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.940
I see.

02:51.600 --> 02:54.940
It's a very fancy name.

03:37.980 --> 03:39.650
I found you.

03:51.910 --> 03:54.170
This time, it's Sachi's turn.

03:57.090 --> 03:59.630
Not yet.

04:02.260 --> 04:05.340
Not yet.

04:09.020 --> 04:11.180
I'm ready.

05:23.840 --> 05:25.316
Come here.

05:25.340 --> 05:27.366
Cicerone.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.760
Come here, Cicerone.

05:48.780 --> 05:50.660
Sachi?

05:51.950 --> 05:53.700
Sachi?

08:37.280 --> 08:38.466
Satchan.

08:38.490 --> 08:44.000
Satchan. Satchan. Satchan.
Satchan. Satchan. Satchan. Satchan.

10:17.800 --> 10:22.760
Neko-machi Alley.

11:13.650 --> 11:16.150
"Here, come in, you two..."

11:42.840 --> 11:50.560
The Running Man.

14:05.940 --> 14:08.006
Left and right engine outputs nominal.

14:08.030 --> 14:09.676
Pressure level normal.

14:09.700 --> 14:11.216
Heart rate increasing.

14:11.240 --> 14:12.846
Perspiration increasing.

14:12.870 --> 14:14.240
Brain waves, no abnormalities.

14:15.120 --> 14:18.516
At the time, due to a request
from a certain magazine,

14:18.540 --> 14:21.146
I was writing an article on Zach Hugh.

14:21.170 --> 14:24.170
The brutal race, which sends
countless racers to their deaths,

14:24.380 --> 14:25.816
Death Circus.

14:25.840 --> 14:32.276
As its champion, Zach Hugh was the man who
reigned on its throne for nearly ten years.

14:32.300 --> 14:35.996
His magnificent, death-defying
control of his machine

14:36.020 --> 14:39.206
drove the audience wild.

14:39.230 --> 14:40.746
Zach the Grim Reaper.

14:40.770 --> 14:42.206
The Immortal Man.

14:42.230 --> 14:45.296
He was given many names.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.320
However...

14:55.950 --> 14:57.636
Contact spacing, unstable.

14:57.660 --> 15:00.516
Heart rate, perspiration, still increasing.

15:00.540 --> 15:02.766
Ocular response declining.

15:02.790 --> 15:07.066
At that point, the repeated
strain of the brutal race

15:07.090 --> 15:10.630
had already destroyed his mind and body.

16:48.820 --> 16:50.006
He's reached his limits.

16:50.030 --> 16:52.400
He can't take the shock
from the machine any longer.

17:57.840 --> 18:00.430
It's not possible to continue any longer.
Have him forfeit.

18:06.940 --> 18:09.036
Chief, he's not slowing down.

18:09.060 --> 18:10.440
What?!

21:03.400 --> 21:05.426
This is unbelievable...

21:05.450 --> 21:06.450
Chief!

21:07.700 --> 21:08.700
Look!

21:15.080 --> 21:20.090
After crossing the goal, his machine
continued to accelerate even more.

21:20.710 --> 21:22.170
He continued to run.

25:50.860 --> 25:52.150
Zach Hugh.

25:53.110 --> 25:56.450
He was a great champion.

25:58.280 --> 26:03.330
But, his death is still
shrouded in mystery.

27:01.300 --> 27:08.036
You know that five days ago a
coup occurred in the Aloana Republic?

27:08.060 --> 27:09.060
Yes.

27:10.100 --> 27:13.996
I'm sure you're also aware that in the
country's Piraru River region's jungle

27:14.020 --> 27:18.546
our company's 444th
construction project is progressing?

27:18.570 --> 27:19.467
Yes.

27:19.491 --> 27:26.426
This project is a strategic step for us to achieve
a foothold in the resource rich Aloana Republic.

27:26.450 --> 27:30.726
But, three days ago, Aloana's
new government sent us

27:30.750 --> 27:34.090
a unilateral decision to
cancel the construction contract.

27:34.960 --> 27:36.606
Do you understand?

27:36.630 --> 27:37.607
I see.

27:37.631 --> 27:39.446
No, you don't see!

27:39.470 --> 27:40.946
It's been cancelled! Cancelled!

27:40.970 --> 27:43.890
That construction project's been cancelled!

27:44.930 --> 27:50.350
Construction Cancellation Order.

28:14.710 --> 28:17.000
Mister, you just ran a light.

28:21.510 --> 28:23.736
According to the notice

28:23.760 --> 28:27.036
we must cease the construction
immediately and, in addition

28:27.060 --> 28:32.326
get this, the deferred payment for the breach of
contract is going to be made over twenty years.

28:32.350 --> 28:33.956
Twenty years?!

28:33.980 --> 28:38.376
It is true that #444 is
quite a difficult construction.

28:38.400 --> 28:41.666
The designated area is a swampland
sandwiched by higher ground.

28:41.690 --> 28:45.596
When the rainy season comes,
the whole area turns into a river.

28:45.620 --> 28:48.556
And when the water recedes,
next comes the vegetation.

28:48.580 --> 28:55.186
It grows like a monster and turns the place
back into a jungle in less than six months.

28:55.210 --> 28:56.556
It's an unreal place!

28:56.580 --> 28:57.856
Ah, I see.

28:57.880 --> 29:02.896
Construction #444 began with the
appropriation of an enormous budget.

29:02.920 --> 29:07.156
Currently, it's still proceeding
to expend an enormous budget.

29:07.180 --> 29:11.826
Before the losses spread any further,
we must cease operations immediately

29:11.850 --> 29:13.746
and pull our assets out.

29:13.770 --> 29:14.826
Then you should instruct the site...

29:14.850 --> 29:17.286
We sent the cancellation
order out to the site manager...

29:17.310 --> 29:18.456
Well, then...

29:18.480 --> 29:20.706
The day we sent the cancellation order

29:20.730 --> 29:22.796
he disappeared and we haven't
had any communication since.

29:22.820 --> 29:24.086
He's missing?

29:24.110 --> 29:26.636
Because of the way
the construction site is,

29:26.660 --> 29:29.636
we depend solely on
robots for the labour force.

29:29.660 --> 29:33.766
The only human being there was
the man who was the site manager.

29:33.790 --> 29:35.096
Then...

29:35.120 --> 29:37.106
Even as we speak, those damn puppet robots

29:37.130 --> 29:39.630
are taking expensive materials
and chucking them into the mud.

29:40.380 --> 29:43.486
Finding the missing
previous foreman and halting

29:43.510 --> 29:47.276
the 444th construction project immediately

29:47.300 --> 29:49.946
is the reason why you are being dispatched.

29:49.970 --> 29:52.576
We're counting on you, Sugioka.

29:52.600 --> 29:53.640
Yes, Sir.

30:07.820 --> 30:09.450
What is that?

30:12.950 --> 30:15.960
Safety First.

30:23.300 --> 30:25.970
Would you be the foreman, sir?

30:31.550 --> 30:34.196
This place is unbelievable.

30:34.220 --> 30:39.456
Please state your name and employee number.

30:39.480 --> 30:42.110
Oh! Ah! Hey! What are you doing?!

30:42.440 --> 30:46.086
Well then, mister, call us when
you're done with your work here!

30:46.110 --> 30:47.990
We'll be by to pick you up!

30:49.280 --> 30:51.256
Uh, you're going already?!

30:51.280 --> 30:52.506
Hey, wait a...

30:52.530 --> 30:55.080
Mister, be careful!

30:56.120 --> 30:57.846
Wait! Wait!

30:57.870 --> 30:58.870
Hey! You!

31:00.000 --> 31:02.460
What are they in a hurry for?

31:03.210 --> 31:06.186
If they've broken the camera or something
I'm going to have them replace it.

31:06.210 --> 31:08.566
They've got to be kidding.

31:08.590 --> 31:13.430
Who knows what people
lacking culture think.

31:15.140 --> 31:16.946
I agree.

31:16.970 --> 31:21.440
I require confirmation of
name and employee number.

31:22.150 --> 31:26.006
Yeah, what was the name of the
previous foreman that disappeared?

31:26.030 --> 31:28.280
Do you know where he went?

31:28.780 --> 31:32.846
If you do not state your name
and your employee number

31:32.870 --> 31:36.306
it means that you are not the
recognised as the proper foreman.

31:36.330 --> 31:41.146
If you are not recognised as the
proper foreman, then you will be

31:41.170 --> 31:45.356
considered unrelated to the construction...

31:45.380 --> 31:47.146
Anyway, show me to the dormitory.

31:47.170 --> 31:49.170
You can give me the details there.

31:49.195 --> 31:52.196
Or possibly someone who intends to
interfere with the construction efforts

31:52.220 --> 31:55.260
and will be repelled and...

31:57.600 --> 31:59.560
Tsutomu Sugioka.

32:00.060 --> 32:03.326
Employee number CX88.

32:03.350 --> 32:06.730
Confirmation... completed.

32:08.820 --> 32:14.386
Welcome, for having come
from so far Mr. Foreman.

32:14.410 --> 32:16.216
Yeah, nice to meet you.

32:16.240 --> 32:20.580
I am #1 of 444...

32:22.330 --> 32:25.606
...is how it is done.

32:25.630 --> 32:30.316
Orders regarding construction
#444 are all transmitted from myself

32:30.340 --> 32:33.606
to other robots in charge.

32:33.630 --> 32:36.196
Oh, good grief.

32:36.220 --> 32:38.536
They're working at it so hard.

32:38.560 --> 32:42.076
All the foreman's orders
must go through me as well.

32:42.100 --> 32:48.296
If we do not use this system, the chain
of command will be thrown into chaos.

32:48.320 --> 32:53.756
Well, I want you to use that system and convey
to all the robots the new foreman's orders.

32:53.780 --> 32:55.926
It has been decided that this
construction is to be cancelled.

32:55.950 --> 32:58.096
Cease work immediately and...

32:58.120 --> 32:59.846
Hey! Wait a second!

32:59.870 --> 33:01.226
I'm not done with my orders yet!

33:01.250 --> 33:02.057
Hey!

33:02.081 --> 33:03.386
Hey! Hey!

33:03.410 --> 33:04.410
You!

33:05.500 --> 33:06.646
What's the meaning of this!

33:06.670 --> 33:06.960
Hey!

33:07.170 --> 33:12.396
Mr. Foreman must be
exhausted by the long journey,

33:12.420 --> 33:16.026
so I will take my leave for today.

33:16.050 --> 33:18.576
Why do you need to lock the door! You!

33:18.600 --> 33:22.245
This area is rife with harmful
insects and this is for your safety.

33:22.270 --> 33:24.366
In any case, open this door!

33:24.390 --> 33:25.536
Hey!

33:25.560 --> 33:27.166
You!

33:27.190 --> 33:28.178
Do you understand me!

33:28.203 --> 33:31.626
Furthermore, tomorrow, your schedule
Come back!

33:31.650 --> 33:33.626
Is on the wall schedule chart.
Hey!

33:33.650 --> 33:36.336
Don't you understand I'm
telling you to come back!

33:36.360 --> 33:37.966
Open this!

33:37.990 --> 33:39.330
Shit!

33:39.355 --> 33:41.176
Please help me! I'm going to be killed! That robot is insane! To my wife, Sachiko. I'm not going to make it. I love you!
I wanted to do it one more time. Tooru, listen to your mother. Study hard and become an upstanding human being. O...

33:41.200 --> 33:43.096
Don't you understand!

33:43.120 --> 33:45.436
Open it!

33:45.460 --> 33:46.540
Hey!

34:03.060 --> 34:05.956
Breakfast will be until
30 minutes past the hour.

34:05.980 --> 34:12.836
At 45 minutes past the hour until 10:25 will
be an inspection tour of the first site.

34:12.860 --> 34:15.900
At 10:30, in the reference room...

35:12.000 --> 35:14.976
See, it is right over there
where the construction

35:15.000 --> 35:17.630
is delayed the most; The 8th district.

35:38.860 --> 35:41.926
Hey! What's wrong with that robot?

35:41.950 --> 35:43.386
It's overheated.

35:43.410 --> 35:47.386
The work is very harsh so
his circuits must have given out.

35:47.410 --> 35:48.700
Ridiculous!

35:49.580 --> 35:53.016
How much do you think
that single robot costs?!

35:53.040 --> 35:54.960
It's more expensive than an airliner!

35:55.210 --> 36:00.276
The work is experiencing delays so I
am having the robots work at full capacity.

36:00.300 --> 36:04.906
My job is to ensure that the construction
is completed by the date it's due.

36:04.930 --> 36:08.970
Some sacrifices are unavoidable.

36:09.230 --> 36:11.956
There is no due date anymore!

36:11.980 --> 36:15.770
More importantly, we have
to minimise the losses...

36:15.795 --> 36:18.206
The due date is in one month.

36:18.230 --> 36:24.096
The work is suffering delays so I am
having the robots work at full capacity...

36:24.120 --> 36:25.966
What? What's wrong with you?

36:25.990 --> 36:27.990
Oh, are you angry?

36:34.170 --> 36:37.550
Next, we will inspect district 10.

36:37.960 --> 36:40.590
This way, Mr. Foreman.

36:42.470 --> 36:45.720
W... Wait just a moment, please.

36:52.940 --> 36:55.956
Breakfast will be until
30 minutes past the hour.

36:55.980 --> 37:02.506
At 45 minutes past the hour until 10:25 will
be an inspection tour of the first site.

37:02.530 --> 37:07.215
At 10:30, in the reference room,
please examine the previous.

37:07.240 --> 37:08.636
What's this?

37:08.660 --> 37:12.096
Month's construction reports and paperwork.

37:12.120 --> 37:13.120
At 12:30...

37:59.500 --> 38:04.590
It is about time for the
inspection tour, Mr. Foreman.

38:15.020 --> 38:16.140
Hey! Wait!

38:19.440 --> 38:20.996
I can't take this any more!

38:21.020 --> 38:22.626
Make a fool of a human!

38:22.650 --> 38:24.900
Even though I'm normally quiet...

38:26.320 --> 38:30.006
The rainy season is
approaching so beginning today

38:30.030 --> 38:33.580
the robots' workload has been increased.

38:36.000 --> 38:38.080
Who made that order?!

38:38.290 --> 38:41.726
There has been a slight
increase in the loss of robots,

38:41.750 --> 38:44.856
but the rate of construction has increased.

38:44.880 --> 38:46.840
Please be delighted.

38:47.760 --> 38:50.156
A slight increase in the loss of...

38:50.180 --> 38:51.366
How many?!

38:51.390 --> 38:53.486
Today, there have been twenty units.

38:53.510 --> 38:56.850
Tomorrow, there are
twenty-four units scheduled.

38:57.270 --> 39:00.310
We can't just let you
trash those robots like that!

39:01.650 --> 39:03.666
Listen carefully, you puppet robot!

39:03.690 --> 39:06.586
Get this! This construction has
been issued a cancellation order!

39:06.610 --> 39:09.200
Cease immediately! Do you understand?!

39:10.320 --> 39:16.056
I judge that statement as an intent to
interfere with the current construction.

39:16.080 --> 39:22.396
Any statements made by you
from here on will have no effect.

39:22.420 --> 39:25.960
Shut up! I told you to stop!
Stop, you stupid robot!

39:26.340 --> 39:31.470
That which interferes with the progress
of the construction must be removed.

39:33.350 --> 39:34.970
Removed?

39:50.320 --> 39:52.926
Beginning today for an indefinite term

39:52.950 --> 39:57.790
the Foreman's inspection tours
of the sites will be cancelled.

40:33.490 --> 40:34.490
This is madness.

40:44.210 --> 40:52.210
Please help me! I'm going to be killed! That robot is insane! To my wife, Sachiko. I'm not going to make it. I love you!
I wanted to do it one more time. Tooru, listen to your mother. Study hard and become an upstanding human being. O...

41:55.030 --> 41:56.796
Good morning.

41:56.820 --> 42:00.410
I have brought you your meal.

42:05.830 --> 42:06.960
Yes!

42:17.380 --> 42:24.076
Even if you destroy me,
the construction will progress.

42:24.100 --> 42:29.230
We must complete it before
the deadline no matter...

42:30.610 --> 42:33.006
what... progress...

42:33.030 --> 42:34.376
Damn it!

42:34.400 --> 42:36.240
Bastard!

42:53.170 --> 42:54.776
No good!

42:54.800 --> 42:57.146
The puppet robots are still working.

42:57.170 --> 42:58.776
As I thought.

42:58.800 --> 43:00.656
This one's just a terminal.

43:00.680 --> 43:05.140
I need to destroy the system core
or the robots won't stop working.

43:10.650 --> 43:12.770
If I follow this cable...

43:19.240 --> 43:22.426
Emergency communique! An emergency
communique from corporate headquarters!

43:22.450 --> 43:27.016
Early dawn today, there was a
second coup in the new government

43:27.040 --> 43:29.726
of the Aloana Republic and power has
been restored to the former government.

43:29.750 --> 43:32.896
Earlier, there was a press conference
by the former government Damn it!

43:32.920 --> 43:36.026
To announce the resumption of the
444th construction contract. Damn it!

43:36.050 --> 43:36.817
I repeat.

43:36.841 --> 43:40.550
It has been decided that the 444th
construction project will continue. Damn it!

43:40.800 --> 43:42.566
Tsutomu Sugioka!

43:42.590 --> 43:43.696
It's me!

43:43.720 --> 43:45.100
Section chief, Maruyama!

43:45.640 --> 43:46.617
Hey!

43:46.641 --> 43:48.076
Tsutomu Sugioka!

43:48.100 --> 43:49.576
It's me!

43:49.600 --> 43:51.076
Respond!

43:51.100 --> 43:51.787
Hey!

43:51.811 --> 43:53.560
Hey! Sugioka!

46:54.080 --> 46:55.950
Welcome.
